1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,230
Strangers from distant lands, friends of
old, you've been summoned here to answer

2
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:12,020
the threat of Mordor. Middle-earth
stands upon the brink of destruction.

3
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:17,000
None can escape it.
You will unite or you will fall.

4
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:21,900
The Ring was made in
the fires of Mount Doom.

5
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,760
Only there can it be unmade.

6
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:33,730
It must be taken deep into Mordor and cast
back into the fiery chasm from whence it

7
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:34,400
came.

8
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:41,240
One of you must do this.

9
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:07,620
Thank you for watching.
